Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add improved internal linking to 70 remaining city pages

Pattern based on London/Paris/Bangkok/Tokyo/NYC reference pages.
Each page gets three related-content sections before the author box:
1. Region-based city interview links (6 cities from same region)
2. Recommended gear reviews (3 relevant review pages)
3. Related guides (3 relevant guide/destination pages)

- Replaced old 'More City Interviews' sections with new 3-section pattern
- Added .related-section CSS to pages missing it
- Inserted sections before author-box or </article> for stub pages
- City-specific gear/guide overrides for destinations like Dubai, Bali, Cusco, etc.
